{"html":"<div class=\"product_detail\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<img alt=\"제품 상세 공지(탑) - 온라인 가품 유통 주의 안내\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoopm.com/shop/storage/shop_image/Ww8yREXDVplPHT9vZS1WKnZe1DiprZ143KbzqknD.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><br/><br/><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<link href=\"https://hangeul.pstatic.net/hangeul_static/css/nanum-myeongjo.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style type=\"text/css\">@font-face {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Light';src:url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_20-04@2.1/NEXON Lv2 Gothic Light.woff') format('woff');font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}\r\n            @font-face {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic';src:url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_20-04@2.1/NEXON Lv2 Gothic.woff') format('woff');font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}\r\n            .font_NMr {font-family:'NanumMyeongjo' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMeb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoExtraBold' !important;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap * {box-sizing:border-box;word-break:keep-all;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd, p, div, span, section, i, form, fieldset, input, table, tr, th, td, button, textarea, br {margin:0;padding:0;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd {list-style:none;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap img {width:auto;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic', sans-serif;width:100%;max-width:1200px !important;margin:0 auto;font-size:16px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-0.25px;text-align:center;color:#424242;line-height:1.4;}\r\n\r\n            /* 공통 */\r\n            /* 폰트 스타일 */\r\n            .product_detail_wrap p {transform:rotate(0.04deg)}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .psm {font-size:0.75em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p0 {font-size:1.125em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p1 {font-size:1.5em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p2 {font-size:1.75em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p3 {font-size:2em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p4 {font-size:3em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p5 {font-size:5em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p6 {font-size:7.5em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .fw_600 {font-weight:600;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .fw_700 {font-weight:700;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .lh_10 {line-height:1;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .lh_12 {line-height:1.2;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .lh_20 {line-height:2;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .tl {text-align:left;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ls_1 {letter-spacing:1px}\r\n\r\n            /* 칼라 스타일 */\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_white {color:#fff;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_dark {color:#121212;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_gray {color:#8f96a1;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_lightgray {color:#d0d0d0;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_brown {color:#7d5636;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_darkbrown {color:#2e251c;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_naturalbrown {color:#4b362b;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_lightbrown {color:#7b5f46;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .bg_brown {background-color:#e3c7b7;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .bg_gray {background-color:#f9f9f9;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .bg_white {background-color:#fff;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .bg_black {background-color:#000;}\r\n\r\n            /* 간격 스타일 */\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt-05em {margin-top:-0.5em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_03em {margin-top:0.3em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_04em {margin-top:0.4em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_08em {margin-top:0.8em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_1em {margin-top:1em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_30 {margin-top:30px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_50 {margin-top:50px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_70 {margin-top:70px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_100 {margin-top:100px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_150 {margin-top:150px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .pd_2em {padding:2em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .plrb_2em {padding:0 2em 2em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .pd_60 {padding:60px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ptb_80 {padding:80px 0;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ptb_120 {padding:120px 0;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .pt_100 {padding-top:100px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .pb_50 {padding-bottom:50px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:80px;}\r\n\r\n            /* GRID · FLEX 스타일 */\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .grid_3step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 30%);justify-content:space-between;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .grid_rg45 {row-gap:45px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .flex_aic {display:flex;align-items:center}\r\n\r\n            /* 기타 스타일 */\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .w75 {width:75%;margin-left:12.5%;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .w90 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .number_roundbox {display:inline-block;padding:0.5em 0.684em 0.4em;border-radius:150px;background-color:#7d5636;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .bdr_10 {border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ptr {position:relative;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ybr {display:none;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mWidth_10 {max-width:10%;}\r\n\r\n            /* 키이미지 */\r\n            .product_keyimg {background-color:#fafafa;}\r\n            .product_keyimg .color_texbox {display:inline-block;background-color:#4b362b;color:#fff;padding:0.4em 0.9em 0.3em;margin-bottom:1em;}\r\n\r\n            /* 제품 이야기 */\r\n            .product_story_grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:60% 1fr;justify-content:start;align-items:center;background-color:#073020;color:#d9bea3;}\r\n            \r\n            /* 타이틀 */\r\n            .product_title {margin:150px 0 50px;}\r\n            .product_title img {position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:-1;}\r\n            .product_title .product_name {display:inline-block;background-color:#fff;padding:0 1em;font-size:0.75em;}\r\n            .product_title .product_name span {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoExtraBold' !important;}\r\n\r\n            /* 제품특징 */\r\n            .key_point .qna_box {position:absolute;top:120px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);}\r\n            .key_point .qna_box .qna_grid {width:max-content;display:grid;grid-template-columns:3.2em 1fr;justify-content:start;align-items:center;column-gap:1.2em;}\r\n            .key_point .qna_box .qna_grid:nth-of-type(2) {align-items:start;margin-top:1.5em;}\r\n            .key_point .qna_box .qna_grid p:nth-of-type(1) {padding:0.1em 0;border-radius:0.2em;background-color:#fff;}\r\n            .key_point .qna_box .qna_grid p:nth-of-type(2) {color:#fff;text-align:left;}\r\n            .key_point .qna_box .qna_grid p span {font-size:0.75em;}\r\n            /* 콜라겐 이미지 */\r\n            .key_point .white_tbox {position:absolute;background-color:rgba(255, 255, 255, .9);padding:0.3em 0.6em}\r\n            .key_point .white_tbox:nth-of-type(1) {bottom:49%;left:8%;}\r\n            .key_point .white_tbox:nth-of-type(2) {top:24.6%;right:16%;}\r\n            /* KEY POINT */\r\n            .key_point .keypoint_grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:6em 1fr;justify-content:start;align-items:start;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #e1e1e1;}\r\n            .key_point .keypoint_grid:nth-last-child(1) {border-bottom:none;}\r\n\r\n            /* 원료 소개 */\r\n            /* 1.특허 추출물 */\r\n            .ingredients_01 .extract {border-radius:135px;overflow:hidden;background-color:#f9f9f9;}\r\n            .ingredients_01 .extract .txt_01 {padding:0 1em;}\r\n            .ingredients_01 .extract .txt_02 {padding:0 2em 3.5em;}\r\n            .ingredients_01 .extract .txt_03 {width:max-content;position:absolute;top:3em;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:1;font-size:1.25em;}\r\n            .ingredients_01 .extract .img_01 {position:absolute;bottom:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:0;}\r\n            /* 특허증 */\r\n            .ingredients_01 .patent_certificate_grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:34.359% 1fr;justify-content:start;text-align:left;column-gap:5em;}\r\n            .ingredients_01 .patent_certificate_grid .flex_box {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-content:space-between;}\r\n            /* 2.GPH PHYTOHAIRPEP */\r\n            .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p {position:absolute;background-color:#7b8797;border-radius:100%;color:#fff;font-size:1.125em;}\r\n            .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(1) {top:9%;left:34.5%;padding:28px 34px;}\r\n            .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(2) {top:35%;left:16%;background-color:#d9bea3;padding:39.5px 38px;}\r\n            .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(3) {top:14%;right:14.5%;padding:28px 26.5px;}\r\n            .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(4) {top:39%;right:24%;padding:28px 31.5px;}\r\n            .ingredients_02 .peptide_02 p {position:absolute;}\r\n            .ingredients_02 .peptide_02 p:nth-of-type(1) {top:55%;left:8%;text-align:left;}\r\n            .ingredients_02 .peptide_02 p:nth-of-type(2) {top:19.5%;right:8%;text-align:right;}\r\n            /* 3.하이드롤라이즈드 케라틴 */\r\n            .ingredients_03 .keratin_grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 10em;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #bab1ac;border-bottom:1px solid #bab1ac;padding:70px 0;column-gap:1.3em;}\r\n            .ingredients_03 .keratin_grid .keratin_graph p {position:absolute;top:0.5em;}\r\n            .ingredients_03 .keratin_grid .keratin_graph p:nth-of-type(1) {left:25%;transform:translateX(-85%);}\r\n            .ingredients_03 .keratin_grid .keratin_graph p:nth-of-type(2) {left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);}\r\n            .ingredients_03 .keratin_grid .keratin_graph p:nth-of-type(3) {right:25%;transform:translateX(85%);}\r\n            .ingredients_03 .keratin_grid .mw400 {background-color:#d9bea3;width:max-content;border-radius:100%;padding:2.1em 1.5em;transform:translateY(-15%);color:#fff;}\r\n            /* 4.하이드롤라이즈드 콜라겐 */\r\n            .ingredients_04 .collagen_keyword {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;}\r\n            .ingredients_04 .collagen_keyword p {border:2px solid #59bb95;padding:1em 1.2em 0.9em;border-radius:2em;color:#59bb95;margin:0 5px 10px;}\r\n            .ingredients_04 .img_box_01 p {position:absolute;top:8%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:max-content;}\r\n\r\n            /* 권장 대상 */\r\n            .recommend_grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.8em 1fr;align-items:center;gap:1em 0.5em;margin:0 auto;text-align:left;width:max-content;}\r\n\r\n            /* 패치 테스트 방법 */\r\n            .patch_grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 48%);justify-content:space-between;row-gap:36px;}\r\n\r\n            /* 포장 단위 */\r\n            .packaging_grid {position:relative; width:57%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 36%);justify-content:space-between;margin:0 auto;}\r\n            .packaging_grid::after {content:\"\";width:1px;height:60%;position:absolute;top:15%;left:50%;border-right:1px dashed #999;}\r\n\r\n            /* 브랜드 스토리 */\r\n            .brand_grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:40% 56%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border:#e1e1e1 solid 1px;}\r\n            .brand_grid .logo_img {max-width:40% !important;}\r\n\r\n            /* 각종인증사항 */\r\n            .certifi_grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:15% 82%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border:#e1e1e1 solid 1px;}\r\n            .certifi_grid .txt_line {position:relative;}\r\n            .certifi_grid .txt_line:after {content:\"\";width:100%;position:absolute;bottom:-1px;left:0;border-top:1px solid #e1e1e1;}\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1200px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .mt_30 {margin-top:2.5vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .mt_50 {margin-top:4.1667vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .mt_70 {margin-top:5.8333vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .mt_100 {margin-top:8.3333vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .mt_150 {margin-top:12.5vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .pd_60 {padding:5vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .ptb_80 {padding:6.6667vw 0;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .ptb_120 {padding:10vw 0;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .pt_100 {padding-top:8.3333vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .pb_50 {padding-bottom:4.1667vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .grid_rg45 {row-gap:3.75vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .bdr_10 {border-radius:0.8333vw;}\r\n                .product_title {margin:12.5vw 0 4.1667vw;}\r\n                .key_point .qna_box {top:10vw;}\r\n                .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p {font-size:1.3333vw;}\r\n                .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(1) {padding:2.3333vw 2.8333vw;}\r\n                .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(2) {padding:3.2917vw 3.1667vw;}\r\n                .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(3) {padding:2.3333vw 2.2083vw;}\r\n                .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(4) {padding:2.3333vw 2.625vw;}\r\n                .ingredients_03 .keratin_grid {padding:5.8333vw 0;}\r\n                .ingredients_04 .collagen_keyword p {margin:0 0.4167vw 0.8333vw;}\r\n                .patch_grid {row-gap:3.2vw;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1080px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:15px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:960px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:14px;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .w75 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .ybr {display:block;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .nbr {display:none;}\r\n                .key_point .white_tbox:nth-of-type(2) {right:18%;}\r\n                .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p {font-size:2vw;}\r\n                .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(1) {top:11%;left:35%;}\r\n                .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(2) {left:17%;}\r\n                .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(3) {top:14.5%;right:15%;}\r\n                .ingredients_02 .peptide_01 p:nth-of-type(4) {right:24.5%;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:840px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:13px;}\r\n                .key_point .qna_box {top:8vw;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:720px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:12px;word-break:break-all;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:640px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:11px;}\r\n                .key_point .qna_box {top:6vw;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:560px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:10px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:480px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:9px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:400px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:8px;}\r\n            }\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"product_detail_wrap\">\n<section class=\"product_keyimg pb_50\">\n<div class=\"bg_brown pt_100\">\n<p class=\"p3 color_texbox\">NO PPD, NO 암모니아 두피 자극 최소화 염모제</p>\n<p class=\"p5 color_white fw_700 lh_12\">하라힐즈 프로 컬러오리진<br/>\r\n6NB 네츄럴브라운</p>\n<p class=\"p2 font_NMr color_white mt_1em\">HARAHILLS PRO ColorOrigin 6NB Natural Brown</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Harahills_ColorOrigin/6nb_naturalbrown/harahills_colororigin_6nb_keyimg.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p3 color_dark\">우리가 사용하는 수 많은 염색약,</p>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 color_dark\">과연 제대로 만들어졌을까요?</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"product_story_grid\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Harahills_ColorOrigin/6nb_naturalbrown/harahills_colororigin_6nb_img_01.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"pd_2em\">\n<p class=\"p1 font_NMr\">HARAHILLS PRO<br/>\r\nCOLORORIGIN</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">...</p>\n<p class=\"p0 lh_20 mt_1em\">‘하라힐즈 프로 컬러오리진’이 추구하는 안전함은<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n자연과 식물이 주는 깨끗함과<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n아름다움을 위한 전문 기술력이 뛰어난 제품을 뜻합니다.</p>\n<p class=\"p0 lh_20 mt_1em\">어쩌면 상반될 수 있는 두가지 본질을 동시에 담기 위해<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n'하라힐즈 프로 컬러오리진'은<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n끊임없는 테스트 과정을 통해 개발되었습니다.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"product_title\">\n<div class=\"ptr\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/Harahills_ColorOrigin/product_name_line.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"product_name font_NMr\">HARAHILLS PRO COLORORIGIN<br/>\n<span>6NB NATURAL BROWN</span></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 mt_04em color_dark\">제품 특징</p>\n<p class=\"p0 font_NMr mt_03em\">KEY POINT</p>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"key_point\">\n<div class=\"ptr\">\n<div class=\"qna_box\">\n<p class=\"p3 color_white\">금방이라도 끊어질 것 같은 모발엔</p>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 color_white\">“달팽이점액추출물”</p>\n<div class=\"qna_grid mt_50\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_700 color_dark\">Q</p>\n<p class=\"p1 fw_600\">달팽이의 몸이 항상 촉촉하게 유지될 수 있는 이유는?</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qna_grid\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_700 color_dark\">A</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">달팽이는 피부에서 끈끈한 점액질인 “뮤신”을 분비하여<br/>\r\n외부환경으로부터 수분 손실을 막아 건조함을 막아냅니다.<br/>\n<span>* 달팽이의 